+//! Santos playback boundary for Pipeline.
+//!
+//! The UI keeps the upstream Pipeline metadata/provider layer. Playback is
+//! deliberately isolated here: yt-dlp resolves a stream URL, while the GTK
+//! GLArea owns an in-process libmpv render context. The libmpv binary used by
+//! the Santos package contains the existing `santos_vdx` H.264 decoder; this
+//! module does not implement a second hardware decoder.
